@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy & Data Protection";
}

<div class="container py-5">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        <span class="text-uppercase fw-bold text-muted small" style="letter-spacing: 0.05em;">Compliance & Customer Care</span>
        <h1 class="display-5 fw-bold mb-3">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="text-muted">Effective Date: November 2026 &bull; Governing Jurisdiction: New Zealand</p>
        <hr class="my-4" />

        <h3 class="fw-bold mt-4">1. Commitment to the New Zealand Privacy Act 2020</h3>
        <p>
            Apex Car Rentals Limited is committed to safeguarding customer personal information in strict adherence to the Information Privacy Principles (IPPs) defined under the New Zealand Privacy Act 2020.
        </p>

        <h3 class="fw-bold mt-4">2. Collection of Information</h3>
        <p>
            We collect personal information necessary to deliver automotive rental services and verify driver eligibility, including:
        </p>
        <ul>
            <li>Full legal name, contact telephone, and email address.</li>
            <li>Driver's licence number, issuing jurisdiction, and class validity.</li>
            <li>Rental dates, pickup/return locations, and vehicle selection history.</li>
            <li>Payment transaction references (we do not retain full raw credit card PAN or CVV data).</li>
        </ul>

        <h3 class="fw-bold mt-4">3. Use and Disclosure</h3>
        <p>
            Your information is used solely for processing reservations, vehicle security, roadside breakdown assistance, and mandatory legal compliance (such as traffic infringement processing under the Land Transport Act 1998). We do not sell or rent customer data to third-party marketing brokers.
        </p>

        <h3 class="fw-bold mt-4">4. Storage & Security</h3>
        <p>
            Data is protected using encrypted database storage, strict role-based access controls, and TLS 1.3 transport security. Identity records are audited regularly to prevent unauthorized disclosure.
        </p>

        <h3 class="fw-bold mt-4">5. Access & Correction Rights</h3>
        <p>
            Under Principle 6 and Principle 7 of the Privacy Act 2020, you have the right to request access to and correction of any personal information held by Apex Car Rentals. Inquiries should be addressed to <code>privacy@apexcarrentals.co.nz</code>.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>
